!CHECK 216407.00 | 215470.40 80 | line 22 SIC,SCOMIC -- SCOMIC back-derived, half word only
!CHECK 216407.40 | 215470.10 00 | line 23 B,SCOMM -- SCOMM back-derived, half word only
!CHECK 216410.00 | 216412.00 80 | line 24 ,YMFCM -- NULL OPERATION, printed with an empty operation field
